12. GEOSPATIAL DATA

WastePay uses:

- PostgreSQL.
- PostGIS.
- Geographic coordinates.
- Spatial queries.
- Depot service zones.
- Collection request mapping.



--------------------------------------------------


13. FINANCIAL IMMUTABILITY RULES

Financial records:

- Cannot be deleted.
- Cannot be overwritten.
- Must remain permanently auditable.



--------------------------------------------------


14. BUSINESS RULES

- All data relationships are normalized.
- Historical transactions are immutable.
- Geographic data is natively supported.
- Audit logging is mandatory.
- Environmental intelligence data is permanently preserved.
- Pricing rules are versioned.
- Corporate accountability metrics are continuously updated.



--------------------------------------------------


15. FUTURE CAPABILITIES

The WastePay database architecture supports:

- Multi-country operations.
- National environmental reporting.
- Government partnerships.
- Corporate sustainability programs.
- AI-powered analytics.
- Africa-wide plastic intelligence initiatives.
- Circular economy infrastructure.


